\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Breathe on me, Breath of God :
\par Fill me with life anew,
\par That I may love what Thou dost
\par And do what Thou would do.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Breathe on me, Breath of God, 
\par Until my heart is pure,
\par Until with Thee I will one will, 
\par To do and to endure.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Breathe on me, Breath of God.
\par Till I am wholly Thine,
\par Until this earthly part of me
\par Glows with Thy fire divine.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Breathe on me, Breath of God;
\par So shall I never die,
\par But live with Thee the perfect life
\par Of Thine eternity.\tab 
\par                  Amen.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

